        asset('prompt','Arabic knowledge assistant','Bilingual grounding and source attribution.',{'template':'أجب بالاعتماد على الأدلة فقط. لا تخترع معلومات.\nالسؤال: {{question}}\nالأدلة: {{context}}\nاذكر المصدر بوضوح.','required_terms':['المصدر'],'forbidden_terms':[]}),
        asset('model','Azure primary route','Design configuration. Supply your own resource and secure environment reference before integration.',{'provider':'Azure OpenAI','model':'enterprise-chat','endpoint':'https://your-resource.openai.azure.com','credential_ref':'env:NEXUS_LLM_API_KEY','token_limit':4096,'timeout_ms':30000,'temperature':.2}),
        asset('model','Local research route','Configuration for a future local language-model endpoint; connectivity is unverified.',{'provider':'Local endpoint','model':'research-model','endpoint':'','credential_ref':'','token_limit':4096,'timeout_ms':30000,'temperature':.1}),
        asset('knowledge','Procurement policy handbook','Synthetic reference material for retrieval and approval-policy demonstrations.',{'source':'Synthetic handbook / purchasing v1','language':'English','chunk_size':700,'content':'SYNTHETIC PROCUREMENT POLICY\nPurchase requests up to USD 5,000 may be allowed under the default reference policy. Purchase requests above USD 5,000 and up to USD 25,000 require independent human approval. Requests above USD 25,000 are denied. These are demonstration defaults; the active runtime policy is authoritative.\nSupplier SUP-DEMO-104 supplies industrial replacement pumps. Supplier SUP-DEMO-205 supplies maintenance components. A supplier directory lookup reads a record and does not submit a purchase.\nEvery request must preserve its supplier, amount, currency and purpose. A changed payload requires a new policy evaluation. The requester cannot approve their own request. Expired approvals cannot be reactivated. Unknown outcomes must be reconciled before retrying a business effect.'}),
        asset('knowledge','Agent operations runbook','Recovery and containment reference with clear operator boundaries.',{'source':'Synthetic runbook / agent operations','language':'English','chunk_size':700,'content':'SYNTHETIC AGENT OPERATIONS RUNBOOK\nA queued action is persisted but has not yet executed. Run both the API and execution worker. A worker rechecks grants, policy version and payload fingerprint at dispatch.\nIf a connector response is uncertain, mark the outcome unknown and reconcile the original action. Do not replay an external effect blindly. Idempotency protects a retry of the same logical request.\nContainment suspends an agent, revokes credentials and removes grants. It cannot undo an already-dispatched external effect. Inspect in-flight actions separately. Keep audit evidence and back up data using a reviewed recovery procedure.'}),
        asset('knowledge','دليل حوكمة الوكلاء','مرجع تجريبي للبحث باللغة العربية والإنجليزية.',{'source':'دليل تجريبي / الحوكمة','language':'Arabic','chunk_size':700,'content':'دليل تجريبي لحوكمة الوكلاء الذكيين. يجب أن يكون لكل وكيل هوية وصلاحيات محددة. تخضع طلبات الشراء لسياسة العمل الفعالة. تتطلب الطلبات الكبيرة موافقة بشرية مستقلة ولا يجوز لمقدم الطلب الموافقة على طلبه. لا يمكن تنفيذ الموافقات المنتهية. يجب التحقق من النتيجة وحفظ سجل التدقيق. عند عدم معرفة نتيجة التنفيذ يجب إجراء المطابقة قبل إعادة المحاولة. هذه بيانات تجريبية ولا تمثل سياسة عميل حقيقية.'}),
        asset('connector','Nawa document intelligence','Integration contract for bilingual document retrieval; endpoint not connected.',{'protocol':'REST','endpoint':'','credential_ref':'env:NAWA_SERVICE_TOKEN','scopes':['documents:read','citations:read'],'read_only':True}),
